  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1dc66e9658df9284f81f0664a7ee2889, type: 3}
  m_Name: PenelopePassingOnCollectible
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CollectableEntries
  entryTitle: A Note from Penelope (Passing On)
  description: 
  neutralDescription: "Oh, Echo. I forgot how much I missed you while I was stuck
    in this loop. While I would\u2019ve loved to hear something that would\u2019ve
    given me more confidence, I know you tried your best to make sense of everything
    and make passing on easier for me. If there\u2019s another side, I hope to see
    you there."
  negativeDescription: "While I appreciate that Echo basically broke me out of the
    Astral Plane\u2026was right there and then really the time to ask for a reward?
    I didn\u2019t know I was being watched over, it\u2019s not like I asked them
    to do that! Whatever. Thanks, I guess."
  positiveDescription: "Where do I start\u2026I\u2019m heartbroken to learn that
    I\u2019m dead, but I\u2019m really glad you\u2019re still the same sweetheart
    I remember, Echo. The thought of being stuck here, living the same false day
    repeatedly is much scarier than moving on to wherever it is I\u2019m going. I\u2019ll
    be waiting for you there, Echo! XO"
